## Fixture note (exit 139 on scenarios 5/6)
Both crash AFTER all in-scope code paths complete (pinning log + full backend init incl.
device selection + extension enabling). The crash occurs inside Swapchain ctor (todo-7-owned,
unmodified) consuming the harness's deliberately fabricated empty SwapchainInfo; the control
scenario 6 with a VALID configured gpu crashes identically, proving the crash is fixture-
inherent, not related to this change. Production always passes real swapchain infos.

## Empirical finding recorded during debugging
RADV leaves VkPhysicalDevicePCIBusInfoPropertiesEXT ZERO-filled when chained from an instance
whose negotiated API version predates proper struct filling (bare NULL-appInfo instance):
game-side probe saw pci "0:0.0" while the backend's modern-instance probe of the SAME card saw
"4:0.0". probeDevice now treats an all-zero pci triple as unavailable (lenient skip -> name+ids
matching still succeeds). Harness instances request apiVersion 1.3 like real games.

